{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01489","headline":"舞曲歌辞 白紵辞二首 二 · 杨衡","name":"舞曲歌辞 白紵辞二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹑珠履，步琼筵。\n轻身起舞红烛前，芳姿艳态妖且妍。\n回眸转袖暗催弦，凉风萧萧流水急。\n月华泛艳红莲湿，牵裙揽带翻成泣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}